	(text "Series 1N4148W (reverse blocking) -> 220 R -> Q1 pass transistor with Q2 sensing 0.65 V across Rs (100 R || 1 k = 91 R): LED current about 6.5-7 mA from 5 V to 24 V (the 6N137 needs 5-15 mA). At 24 V Q1 dissipates about 125 mW (MMBT5551 is rated 300 mW)."
