	(text "MOD1..8 come from the main board's TCA9535 expander at 3.3 V on J3 pins 19..33. ONE 74AHCT541 on +5V_RAW lifts them to 5 V TTL (AHCT thresholds accept 3.3 V); 47 ohm in series limits a shorted output and damps the ribbon cable."
