	(text "The panel lies FLAT ON THE BACK of the main board (Decision #45). J1 / J2 / J3 are 2x20 MALE headers on the panel's INNER face (B.Cu); they mate J6 / J7 / J8, the FEMALE sockets on the main board's bottom side (its pins are live - user 2026-09-17)."
