	)
	(text "6N137S: VCC and VE on +3V3, 1 k pull-up, output LOW when the input is driven (inverting), 75 ns, 5 kVrms isolation. OPTO_IN1/2 leave on J3 pins 35/37 and land on the ESP32's GPIO16/17 through the link."
